Hospitality-Focused Product Requirement Document (PRD)
1. Domain Context & Hospitality Problem
In hotel and resort operations, the Morning Breakfast Buffet is one of the highest cost drivers and source of guest friction:
	Food Waste / Over-prep: Kitchens over-prepare high-cost protein and dairy items (bacon, sausages, live egg counters) to avoid empty trays during peak hours.
	Late Cancellations & No-Shows: Group bookings, conference delegates, or room cancellations lead to cooked, untouched meals that end up in trash bins.
	Food Shortage Risk: Under-preparing leads to cold/empty buffet stations at 9:00 AM, causing poor guest reviews (NPS/CSAT drops) and extra rush on line cooks.
